{"about_the_game":"In 1987 Dan Hewitt created the greatest game of the 16 bit 68000 generation, Oids. <br><br>This Is my hommage to that game.<br><br>Fight against gravity, attractors and repulsors in this 16 bit inspired side scrolling, arcade, cave flyer/shooter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140290/extras/1e96c8d6bdfdfa84a4e4a6e5c53d5030.poster.avif?t=1756386351\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140290/extras/1e96c8d6bdfdfa84a4e4a6e5c53d5030.webm?t=1756386351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140290/extras/1e96c8d6bdfdfa84a4e4a6e5c53d5030.mp4?t=1756386351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Fly and shoot through a series of levels made up of cavernous terrain littered with attractors,repulsors,guided misslies, defence turrets, shield systems, teleporters, laser triggered missiles and other deadly obstacles.<br><br>Includes Steam Workshop support and integrated level editor.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3140290?t=1756386351","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140290/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756386351","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140290/b2560a669cf5ca1689c6b6909af52aff26537e5a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756386351","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140290/b2560a669cf5ca1689c6b6909af52aff26537e5a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756386351","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":51},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Incl